    <briefdescription>
<para>Interface for providing coordinate transforms between any two frames in a system. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This class provides a simple abstract interface for looking up relationships between arbitrary frames of a system. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
